{
  "title": "Kicked Herbal Egyptian Pomegranate Curry",
  "description": "A flavorful and energizing Egyptian dish featuring pomegranate, this curry is made with a blend of herbal spices and is jain-friendly. It is boiled in a kadhai to bring out the rich flavors of the ingredients.",
  "cuisine": "Egyptian",
